{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14212220","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14212220","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1421222001:1":{"text":"That's strange... The blind mole rat isn't in its cave but wandering around...","source_cn":"好奇怪啊……盲鼹在附近徘徊，而不是在洞穴里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6BDA8F2B234D6EC0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1421222001":{"text":"That's strange... The blind mole rat isn't in its cave but wandering around...","source_cn":"好奇怪啊……盲鼹在附近徘徊，而不是在洞穴里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6BDA8F2B234D6EC0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1421222002:1":{"text":"It's highly likely. Blind mole rats rely on sound to distinguish where to go. If no one guides them, they sometimes can't find their way home...","source_cn":"确实！盲鼹靠声音辨别方向，如果没人指引，它们有时候会找...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D50057F41DC5057","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1421222003:1":{"text":"It does seem like this little critter couldn't find its way home.","source_cn":"看样子，这个小家伙就是找不到自己的洞穴了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51808A308E6CA5D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1421222004:1":{"text":"How did Feli guide it home before?","source_cn":"斐利尔以前是怎么引导它的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7CB48790C8F58314","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1421222005:1":{"text":"Master Feli used to use bells and other instruments to guide lost animals.","source_cn":"斐利尔大人会用铃铛、笛子或者其他乐器引导迷路的小动物们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD18A3AF0079A9ADE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1421222006:1":{"text":"He once said that soothing melodies would make them feel at ease.","source_cn":"他曾经说过，舒缓的旋律能让它们感到安心。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4950AA430E1F75E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1421222006":{"text":"He once said that soothing melodies would make them feel at ease.","source_cn":"他曾经说过，舒缓的旋律能让它们感到安心。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4950AA430E1F75E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1421222007:1":{"text":"Well, let's see if we can lure it out first.","source_cn":"嗯，我们先去找到洞穴。待会就拜托你将它带过来了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x20DED4EFE5E535A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:0:1":{"text":"I can use